      Apple Silicon application. Alongside the classic services it speaks WhatsApp, Telegram,
      Signal, Microsoft Teams and IRCv3 through libpurple plugins, and its XMPP support has
      been carried forward with carbons, client state indication, reactions, HTTP upload,
      OMEMO encryption and encrypted voice and video calls.</description>
    <homepage rdf:resource='https://github.com/KnutMann/adium'/>
    <license rdf:resource='https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-2.0-or-later.html'/>
    <programming-language>Objective-C</programming-language>
    <programming-language>C</programming-language>
    <os>macOS</os>
    <category rdf:resource='https://linkmauve.fr/ns/xmpp-doap#category-client'/>

